        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/b5ac83/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-05T22:02:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not sure if I have the just updated version or not … looking at the list of cards, how come some villains have advanced options, but not all?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The reason is that some of the advanced cards have so few games logged that there's no good estimate for them. &nbsp;I could turn them on anyways but the data would be suspicious at best.</p>",
