      {
        "id": 65151,
        "name": "Katsue",
        "username": "Katsue",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/{size}/2012_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-06T09:10:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For fun, I decided to see what the lowest estimated win rate I could find would be:&nbsp;17%BunkerMr. FixerExpatrietteFreedom Six Absolute Zero&nbsp;vs. The Matriarch&nbsp;in Rook City</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I've seen Bunker be really effective against The Matriarch. The fact that his damage reduction is Equipment, not Ongoing, is a bit help.</p>",
